# 统一换行：仓库内存 LF，检出时 Windows 用 CRLF（脚本与源码保持 LF，避免 shell 脚本失效）
* text=auto

*.sh      text eol=lf
*.bat     text eol=crlf
*.cmd     text eol=crlf

*.py      text eol=lf
*.js      text eol=lf
*.json    text eol=lf
*.md      text eol=lf
*.h       text eol=lf
*.cpp     text eol=lf

# 二进制资源，不做换行转换，diff 也没意义
*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.jpeg    binary
*.gif     binary
*.ico     binary
*.bmp     binary
*.exe     binary
*.vsix    binary
*.zip     binary

# 构建产物与依赖目录在 GitHub 语言统计里不计入
desktop/dist/**          linguist-documentation
vscode-extension/dist/** linguist-documentation
legacy/**                linguist-documentation
docs/**                  linguist-documentation
